  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Taco.png|200px|left|Taco]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 77\n |price = 1 to 331\n |time = 45 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|tacok|bigger|link=Taco Kitchen}}\n |xp = 47\n |base = 92\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 38 min\n}}\n'''Tacos''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 77.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making tacos'''===\n[[File:Taco Kitchen.png|150px|left|Taco Kitchen]]\nTacos are made in the [[Taco Kitchen]].\n\nTo make a taco, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Corn Bread.png|75px|link=Corn Bread|Corn bread]]\n|[[File:Bacon.png|75px|link=Bacon|Bacon]]\n|[[File:Salsa.png|75px|link=Salsa|Salsa]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 45 minutes to make a taco, and 38 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kitchen. Each taco gives players 47 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling tacos'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Tacos can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,310 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 tacos.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a taco costs 374 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Using Taco'''===\nTaco is used to make the following [[products|product]]:\n{{Item Usage|Taco\n|Spicy Bean Taco|1|77\n}}\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 tacos per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Taco\n|es = Taco\n|fr = Taco\n|it = Taco\n|nl = Taco\n|no = Taco\n|ru = Тако\n|zh = Taco\n}}\n[[pt-br:Taco]]\n[[Category:Taco Kitchen Products]]\n[[Category:Corn Bread Products]]\n[[Category:Bacon Products]]\n[[Category:Salsa Products]]",
